John 5:1 , Jesus on the sabbath day cures him that was diseased eight and thirty years;
John 5:10 , The Jews therefore cavil, and persecute him for it;
John 5:17 , He answers for himself, and reproves them, shewing by the testimony of his Father
John 5:31 . of John
John 5:36 . of his works
John 5:39 . and of the scriptures, who he is.
